							</li><li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><a itemprop="item" href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/audi.html"><span itemprop="name">Audi</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="3" />
							</li><li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><a itemprop="item" href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/audi.html#26"><span itemprop="name">A7</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="4" />
							</li><li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><h1 itemprop="name">Audi RS 7 Sportback Performance | 2023MY</h1><meta itemprop="position" content="5" />
							</li></ol><div id="bgimg"><img src="https://images.caricos.com/a/audi/2023_audi_rs_7_performance/images/1920x1080/2023_audi_rs_7_performance_1_1920x1080.jpg" alt="2023 Audi RS 7 Sportback Performance" ></div></div><section class="narrow"><article><div id="article-body"  itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article"><div id="article-info"><time itemprop="datePublished">Published: Dec 02, 2022</time><time itemprop="dateModified">Modified: Jul 03, 2023</time><div>By: <span itemprop="author">Caricos Editors</span></div><input type="hidden" itemprop="publisher" value="Caricos.com"><input type="hidden" itemprop="mainEntityOfPage" value="https://www.caricos.com/cars/a/audi/2023_audi_rs_7_performance/"></div><div itemprop="articleBody"><h2 itemprop="headline">Unleashing Power and Precision: The 2023 Audi RS 6 Avant Performance and RS 7 Sportback Performance</h2>
<p>The latest performance variants of Audi's RS line, the <a href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/a/audi/2023_audi_rs_6_performance/">RS 6 Avant Performance</a> and the RS 7 Sportback Performance, are now revving with boosted power, enhanced handling and sleek aesthetics, marking a new high in Audi's rich performance history. Pushing the boundaries of Audi's twin-turbocharged V8 engine, these models promise to deliver an exhilarating driving experience with their heightened power output, improved dynamics, and distinctive styling.</p>
<h3>Setting a New Power Standard</h3>
<p>The 2023 RS 6 Avant Performance and RS 7 Sportback Performance are the most potent iterations of the RS 6 and RS 7 to date. The vehicles' 4.0-liter V8 biturbo TFSI engine now generates a staggering 630 PS and a peak torque of 850 Nm, marking an increase of 30 PS and 50 Nm over their base versions. The amplified power enables these performance models to catapult from 0 to 100 km/h in a blistering 3.4 seconds, shaving 0.2 seconds off the acceleration time of the standard RS 6 and RS 7.</p>
<p>The Audi engineers have also made some weight-saving adjustments. By reducing the insulation between the engine compartment, the interior, and the rear of the vehicle, not only is the vehicle made lighter, but the sound experience is also significantly amplified. This attention to detail and focus on creating a thrilling driving experience is what sets these new performance models apart.</p>
<img itemprop="image" style="width:100%" alt="Audi RS 7 Sportback Performance | 2023MY |  (Color: Ascari Blue Matt) | Front Three-Quarter" src="https://images.caricos.com/a/audi/2023_audi_rs_7_performance/images/2560x1440/2023_audi_rs_7_performance_4_2560x1440.jpg"><h3>Mastering the Drive</h3>
<p>Audi’s new self-locking center differential plays a vital role in the improved driving dynamics of the 2023 RS 6 Avant Performance and RS 7 Sportback Performance. The power from the turbocharged engine is distributed more precisely to the axles through the eight-speed tiptronic transmission, providing improved cornering and a more agile driving experience overall. </p>
<h3>Wheels that Exude Power and Precision</h3>
<p>Audi offers a choice of 21-inch aluminum cast wheels or a sportier 22-inch lightweight wheel variant, which also contributes to reduced unsprung mass and better throttle response. The lightweight 22-inch wheels are accompanied by high-performance Continental “Sport Contact 7” tires, offering superior grip and more precise handling. These enhancements not only add a visual element to the performance models but also significantly improve their handling and responsiveness.</p>
<h3>Exclusive Package, Greater Dynamics</h3>
<p>Standard in the RS 6 Avant Performance and RS 7 Performance models is the RS Dynamic Package. This includes the increase in top speed to 280 km/h, dynamic all-wheel steering, and the quattro sport differential on the rear axle. For those craving even more, the RS Dynamic Package Plus further pushes the limit with a top speed of 305 km/h and includes the RS ceramic brake system.</p>
<img itemprop="image" style="width:100%" alt="Audi RS 7 Sportback Performance | 2023MY |  (Color: Ascari Blue Matt) | Rear Three-Quarter" src="https://images.caricos.com/a/audi/2023_audi_rs_7_performance/images/2560x1440/2023_audi_rs_7_performance_2_2560x1440.jpg"><h3>Distinctive Look Inside and Out</h3>
<p>The 2023 Audi RS 6 Avant Performance and RS 7 Sportback Performance set themselves apart visually with matte exterior components and blue interior accents, creating an exclusive aesthetic character. Sixteen exterior colors are available, including new metallic and matte Ascari Blue and matte Dew Silver. For the interiors, Audi extends its RS design packages to include blue accents, offering an elegant blend of sportiness and exclusivity.</p>
<h3>A Legacy of Performance</h3>
<p>The latest performance models follow a lineage of Audi's powerful RS plus models, which began with the RS 6 Avant plus in the C5 generation. From the inception of these performance models to the present day, Audi continues to raise the bar with increased power outputs, top speeds, and dynamic improvements, affirming its commitment to delivering extraordinary driving experiences.</p>
<h3>The Verdict</h3>
<p>In conclusion, the 2023 Audi RS 6 Avant Performance and RS 7 Sportback Performance embody the pinnacle of Audi's RS lineage. They exude sophistication in design while housing an engine that delivers a heart-thumping performance. Each improvement, whether it's in power, handling, or aesthetics, builds on the already impressive base models, amplifying the feeling of exclusivity and luxury. It's evident that Audi's dedication to engineering and design has once again raised the bar in the performance vehicle segment.</p>
<h6>-Ed</h6><p class="in-article-collage"><img itemprop="image" src="https://img3.caricos.com/collage/2023_audi_rs_7_performance_0.jpg" alt="2023 Audi RS 7 Sportback Performance"><span>2023 Audi RS 7 Sportback Performance</span></p></div></div><div id="navmj"><div id="navpgmj"><div style="margin: 0 0 0 auto;"><a href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/a/audi/2023_audi_rs_7_performance/#1" id="pgnprev" class="prevnext prev off" title="Previous Page"><span></span></a></div><select id="page-select" label=""><label for="page-select" style="display:none;">Select a Page</label><option value="1">Page 1 / 17</option><option value="2">Page 2 / 17</option><option value="3">Page 3 / 17</option><option value="4">Page 4 / 17</option><option value="5">Page 5 / 17</option><option value="6">Page 6 / 17</option><option value="7">Page 7 / 17</option><option value="8">Page 8 / 17</option><option value="9">Page 9 / 17</option><option value="10">Page 10 / 17</option><option value="11">Page 11 / 17</option><option value="12">Page 12 / 17</option><option value="13">Page 13 / 17</option><option value="14">Page 14 / 17</option><option value="15">Page 15 / 17</option><option value="16">Page 16 / 17</option><option value="17">Page 17 / 17</option></select><div style="margin: 0 auto 0 0;"><a href="https://www.caricos.com/cars/a/audi/2023_audi_rs_7_performance/#2" id="pgnnext" class="prevnext next pna" title="Next Page"><span></span></a></div></div><div id="modelimgnavmj" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageGallery"><div id="galmj" style="width: 1700%; left: 0%;"><div class="galpage" id="galpage1" style="width:5.8823529411765%"><div class="modelimgviewmj" itemprop="image" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><a itemprop="contentUrl" class="modelimgviewimg" href="https://images.caricos.com/a/audi/2023_audi_rs_7_performance/images/2560x1440/2023_audi_rs_7_performance_1_2560x1440.jpg" style="font-size:0.7rem;"><span itemprop="caption">Audi RS 7 Sportback Performance | 2023MY |  (